  <div class="diagram-signature"><VisualAttribution /></div>
  <figcaption>
    Explanatory model: Four complete process stages connect semiconductor dependencies to PFAS evidence,
    quality cost, and the boundary between general, specialized, and human review. Specific entity codes and
    workflow links illustrate the graph architecture.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .semiconductor-traceability-figure {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .semiconductor-traceability-graph {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .stage-title,
  .node-title,
  .node-note,
  .edge-label {
    font-family: var(--font-diagram);
  }

  .stage-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    fill: var(--ie-ink);
  }

  .stage-index {
    fill: var(--ie-blue);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .node-title {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--ie-ink);
  }

  .node-note {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    fill: var(--ie-muted);
  }

  .edge-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--ie-ink-secondary);
  }

  .node-surface,
  .node-primary,
  .node-specialized,
  .node-verified,
  .node-constraint {
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .node-surface {
    fill: var(--ie-surface);
    stroke: var(--ie-rule-strong);
  }

  .node-primary {
    fill: var(--ie-blue-soft);
    stroke: var(--ie-blue);
  }

  .node-specialized,
  .node-verified {
    fill: var(--ie-verified-soft);
    stroke: var(--ie-verified);
  }

  .node-constraint {
    fill: var(--ie-rust-soft);
    stroke: var(--ie-rust);
  }

  .constraint-text { fill: var(--ie-rust); }

  .edge-blue,
  .edge-green,
  .edge-rust {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .edge-blue { stroke: var(--ie-blue); }
  .edge-green { stroke: var(--ie-verified); }
